{"about_the_game":"From their unassailable fortress on the moon, a mysterious organization called Altair sends out letters of invitation to psychics around the world. Those who accept the invitation must participate in a psychic battle arena and compete for the ultimate prize: a single wish granted.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unconventional turn-based combat featuring a damage-boosting combo system and action commands. Commit acts of violence!<br></li><li>Clear the various districts of Juno 06 in any order you like. Play difficult maps out of order.<br></li><li>Level up your units within the confines of each stage to heal them. Be careful not to let your enemies level up.<br></li><li>Assemble a team from a diverse selection of classes. Recruit allies as you clear stages.<br></li><li>Experiment with different badge effects and varying setups. Puzzle out your own route through Juno 06's battle network.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Space Cadet","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1886270/512837826b8e337cbd3ffe8df6b7a3b018314506.jpg"},{"name":"Battle Circuit Champion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1886270/9d3bd506baa111102d61b19488abddcd1e7210c0.jpg"},{"name":"Interpol Detective","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1886270/f2fc6536f16d23a383d4f1c785d2ed17630630a5.jpg"},{"name":"Hidden Purpose","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1886270/3cab57c040ce61281a9bf10cb4a364a385604702.jpg"},{"name":"The Final Conspiracy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1886270/e83c7c6074311b3f6ae9fa01b78bd009118d678c.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1886270?t=1770000415","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1886270?t=1770000415","capsule_image"